# Allow-list: exclude everything, then admit only what the backend image needs.
# Anything not re-included below (.env, real statements, vault_storage, kaggle data,
# docs, frontend, virtualenvs) can never end up in the image.
*

!backend/
!sample_statements/

# Re-exclude things inside the admitted folders
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
backend/.venv/
backend/venv/
backend/tests/
backend/requirements-dev.txt
